Revision history for {{$dist->name}}

{{$NEXT}}
  - initial version
  - dump() writes a Fastly service version (custom VCL, snippets,
    dictionaries, ACLs) to a directory of .vcl and .yml files plus an
    index.yml manifest, using symbolic id references rather than literal
    API ids
  - load() uploads such a directory into an unrelated service version and
    returns the resolved id mapping
  - new() accepts fastly_cli / fastly_profile / fastly_config options to
    read the API token (and endpoint) from the Fastly CLI's config.toml,
    located per-platform the same way the CLI locates it
  - added the cfvd command (App::cfvd) with dump and load subcommands
